{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25794","headline":"忆至巩县河宿待家累追怀 · 李绅","name":"忆至巩县河宿待家累追怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巩树翻红秋日斜，水分伊洛照余霞。\n弓开後骑低初月，鹗驻前旌拂暮鸦。\n闺信坐迟青玉案，弄儿闲望白羊车。\n今来忆事凉风晚，烟浦空悲黄菊花。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25794.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25794","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}